<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Reset Your Password - Nexora</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #F8F6F0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #111111;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    .wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      background-color: #F8F6F0;
      padding: 40px 16px;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1px solid #EAE6DC;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
    }
    .header {
      background-color: #0C1413;
      padding: 36px 32px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .brand {
      color: #FFFFFF;
      font-size: 24px;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .brand-accent {
      color: #10B981;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 36px 32px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background-color: rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.12);
      color: #0F766E;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .greeting {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #0D1B1A;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    p {
      margin: 0 0 16px 0;
      color: #4B5563;
      font-size: 15px;
    }
    .button-box {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 32px 0 24px 0;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #0F766E;
      color: #FFFFFF !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 14px 32px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 14px;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }
    .footer {
      background-color: #FAFAF9;
      border-top: 1px solid #EAE6DC;
      padding: 24px 32px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #9CA3AF;
    }
    .footer a {
      color: #0F766E;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1 class="brand">NEXORA<span class="brand-accent">.</span></h1>
      </div>
      <div class="content">
        <span class="badge">Security Credentials</span>
        <h2 class="greeting">Password Reset Request</h2>
        <p>Hello <%= user.firstname %>,</p>
        <p>We received a request to reset your password for your Nexora account. Click the button below to choose a new, secure password:</p>

        <div class="button-box">
          <a href="<%= resetUrl %>" class="btn">Reset My Password</a>
        </div>

        <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #6B7280;">This password reset link will expire in 30 minutes. If you did not request a password change, you can safely ignore this email — your existing password remains fully secure.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        &copy; <%= year %> Nexora Maison. All rights reserved.<br>
        <a href="<%= clientUrl %>">Visit Nexora Storefront</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
